{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QReebFlowOnColorCoords","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QReebFlowOnColorCoords","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.qReebFlowSector_spectator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.qReebFlowSector_spectator","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-reeb-flow-on-color-coords.lean#L34-L37","doc":"A spectator sector (`k = 0`) is fixed by the flow. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.qReebFlowSector_comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.qReebFlowSector_comp","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-reeb-flow-on-color-coords.lean#L27-L32","doc":"**Composition.** Sequential q-Reeb flows compose additively in the flow\nparameter: `φ^q_{t₁} ∘ φ^q_{t₂} = φ^q_{t₁+t₂}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalReeb.qReebFlowSector","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalReeb.qReebFlowSector","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/q-reeb-flow-on-color-coords.lean#L22-L25","doc":"Angular action of the q-Reeb flow on one color sector: a strand at angle\n`ψ` with signed rate multiplier `k` is advanced by `k·q·t`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}